            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.98</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Enhance</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Upscaled videos play.</b> Topaz video results open in the preview and in QuickTime. Videos downloaded earlier are repaired the first time you open them.</li>
<li><b>The reason instead of "Price unknown".</b> If a video is too long or too large for the selected enhancer, the Enhance panel names the limit.</li>
<li><b>Large results arrive in full.</b> Very large upscales are delivered completely, however big the file.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
