            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.97</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Auto top-up</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Your own amount.</b> Enter how much to top up and the balance at which it kicks in, up to 1,000 EUR per top-up.</li>
<li><b>An invoice every time.</b> Every automatic top-up now comes with a proper invoice, and VAT is added on top, as with regular purchases.</li>
<li><b>Clear when your bank asks.</b> If your bank wants to confirm a payment, auto top-up pauses and tells you what to do.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
